# Generated build products and editor state
**/build/
**/.qtc_clangd/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/Makefile
**/Makefile.*
**/.qmake.stash

# Local packaging / runtime snapshots are uploaded as release assets instead
# of entering the Git history.
release/*.zip

# Local SQLite and transient logs can contain operator data. The curated
# copies under data/ are intentionally tracked; future runtime copies are not.
*.db-journal
*.db-wal

